{
  "story_id": "brother-of-the-storm",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 356304,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "For the next three hours Kai told Aiko what to do and she did it.",
      "start_ms": 1408,
      "end_ms": 5125
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "She did not argue.",
      "start_ms": 5125,
      "end_ms": 6195
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "She did not even think about arguing.",
      "start_ms": 6195,
      "end_ms": 8335
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "He was completely different.",
      "start_ms": 8335,
      "end_ms": 9968
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "He knew exactly what needed to happen.",
      "start_ms": 9968,
      "end_ms": 12165
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "He had them fill every container in the cabin with water — the storm could knock out the pump.",
      "start_ms": 12165,
      "end_ms": 17515
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "He had them bring in enough firewood for two days.",
      "start_ms": 17515,
      "end_ms": 20387
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "He had them put boards over the two windows facing west, where the storm was coming from.",
      "start_ms": 20387,
      "end_ms": 25456
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "He had them bring in all the outside things — the axe, the fishing gear, the small chair from the porch — because anything left outside would become a projectile in the wind.",
      "start_ms": 25456,
      "end_ms": 35311
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "He had them tie down the small fishing boat with an extra rope.",
      "start_ms": 35311,
      "end_ms": 38972
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "He was fast and he was decisive.",
      "start_ms": 38972,
      "end_ms": 40830
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "He did not stop to explain most things.",
      "start_ms": 40830,
      "end_ms": 43083
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "When Aiko started to ask, he said, \"Ask me later.",
      "start_ms": 43083,
      "end_ms": 45899
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Right now just do this.\" She did.",
      "start_ms": 45899,
      "end_ms": 47814
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "She trusted him.",
      "start_ms": 47814,
      "end_ms": 48771
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "She was surprised at how much she trusted him.",
      "start_ms": 48771,
      "end_ms": 51475
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "At six o'clock, when they had done everything they could think of, they went back inside.",
      "start_ms": 51475,
      "end_ms": 56543
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Kai locked the door.",
      "start_ms": 56543,
      "end_ms": 57726
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "He barred it — she had not known there was a heavy wooden bar for the door, but there was, and he showed her where it was kept and how to slide it.",
      "start_ms": 57726,
      "end_ms": 66061
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "He checked in with the coast guard on the radio.",
      "start_ms": 66061,
      "end_ms": 68820
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "He said everything was secure.",
      "start_ms": 68820,
      "end_ms": 70566
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "The woman said the storm was now expected within the hour.",
      "start_ms": 70566,
      "end_ms": 73889
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "She wished them luck.",
      "start_ms": 73889,
      "end_ms": 75128
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Kai turned off the radio.",
      "start_ms": 75128,
      "end_ms": 76536
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "He sat down at the kitchen table.",
      "start_ms": 76536,
      "end_ms": 78581
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "Aiko sat across from him.",
      "start_ms": 78581,
      "end_ms": 80145
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "She looked at him.",
      "start_ms": 80145,
      "end_ms": 81288
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "For the first time all day, she really looked at him.",
      "start_ms": 81288,
      "end_ms": 84536
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "He looked older than she had thought.",
      "start_ms": 84536,
      "end_ms": 86821
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "He was fifteen but he looked, in that moment, more like twenty.",
      "start_ms": 86821,
      "end_ms": 90671
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "His face was tired but calm.",
      "start_ms": 90671,
      "end_ms": 92415
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "His hands were still.",
      "start_ms": 92415,
      "end_ms": 93738
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "She said, quietly, \"Kai.",
      "start_ms": 93738,
      "end_ms": 95242
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "How did you know what to do.\" Kai looked at her.",
      "start_ms": 95242,
      "end_ms": 98189
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "He said, \"Dad taught me.",
      "start_ms": 98189,
      "end_ms": 99693
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Dad has been teaching me for years.",
      "start_ms": 99693,
      "end_ms": 101858
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "He taught me the whole storm procedure when I was thirteen.",
      "start_ms": 101858,
      "end_ms": 105467
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "He taught me again last winter.",
      "start_ms": 105467,
      "end_ms": 107392
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "He said — someday I would need to know it, when he was not there.",
      "start_ms": 107392,
      "end_ms": 111362
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "I did not know that day would be today.",
      "start_ms": 111362,
      "end_ms": 113768
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "But I knew it would come sometime.",
      "start_ms": 113768,
      "end_ms": 115873
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "So I paid attention.\"",
      "start_ms": 115873,
      "end_ms": 117257
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Aiko was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 117257,
      "end_ms": 119001
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "She said, \"Kai.",
      "start_ms": 119001,
      "end_ms": 119963
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Why do you always seem so — I don't know.",
      "start_ms": 119963,
      "end_ms": 122489
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Why do you seem like you don't care about things.\" Kai looked at her.",
      "start_ms": 122489,
      "end_ms": 126700
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "He was not offended.",
      "start_ms": 126700,
      "end_ms": 127963
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "He seemed to have expected the question.",
      "start_ms": 127963,
      "end_ms": 130429
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "He said, \"I do care about things.",
      "start_ms": 130429,
      "end_ms": 132474
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "I do a lot of things.",
      "start_ms": 132474,
      "end_ms": 133797
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "You just don't see them because you are not the person I do them for.\" He was quiet.",
      "start_ms": 133797,
      "end_ms": 138910
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Then he said, \"I help Dad with a lot of things.",
      "start_ms": 138910,
      "end_ms": 141797
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "He teaches me — how to fix things.",
      "start_ms": 141797,
      "end_ms": 143902
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "How to read the sea.",
      "start_ms": 143902,
      "end_ms": 145165
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "How to keep everyone safe.",
      "start_ms": 145165,
      "end_ms": 146789
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "But he does it — quietly.",
      "start_ms": 146789,
      "end_ms": 148353
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Because he knows I don't want you and Mom to see me trying and failing.",
      "start_ms": 148353,
      "end_ms": 152684
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "That would be embarrassing.",
      "start_ms": 152684,
      "end_ms": 154368
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "So we do it when you are asleep or when you are reading or when you are somewhere else.\"",
      "start_ms": 154368,
      "end_ms": 159781
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "\"So you have been learning this stuff for years,\" Aiko said.",
      "start_ms": 159781,
      "end_ms": 163451
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "\"Yes,\" said Kai.",
      "start_ms": 163451,
      "end_ms": 164473
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "\"I have.",
      "start_ms": 164473,
      "end_ms": 165014
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Also — you know, Aiko.",
      "start_ms": 165014,
      "end_ms": 166398
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "You think I don't help much.",
      "start_ms": 166398,
      "end_ms": 168142
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "But that is because I am a teenager and I am supposed to look like I don't help much.",
      "start_ms": 168142,
      "end_ms": 173315
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "That is one of my jobs.",
      "start_ms": 173315,
      "end_ms": 174758
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "If I helped visibly and cheerfully, that would be weird.",
      "start_ms": 174758,
      "end_ms": 178187
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "So I look grumpy and I go to my room a lot.",
      "start_ms": 178187,
      "end_ms": 180833
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "But actually I am learning things all the time.",
      "start_ms": 180833,
      "end_ms": 183721
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "And when there is a storm and Dad is not here, I am not confused about what to do.",
      "start_ms": 183721,
      "end_ms": 188713
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "I know what to do.",
      "start_ms": 188713,
      "end_ms": 189856
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Because I have paid attention.",
      "start_ms": 189856,
      "end_ms": 191720
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "That is the whole point.\"",
      "start_ms": 191720,
      "end_ms": 193224
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Aiko sat there.",
      "start_ms": 193224,
      "end_ms": 194122
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "She was quiet for a long time.",
      "start_ms": 194122,
      "end_ms": 195862
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "She was thinking about all the things she had thought about Kai over the years.",
      "start_ms": 195862,
      "end_ms": 200353
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "She was thinking about how many of them had been wrong.",
      "start_ms": 200353,
      "end_ms": 203497
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "She was thinking about how it was possible to live in the same house as someone for ten years and not really see them.",
      "start_ms": 203497,
      "end_ms": 210177
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "She said, \"Kai.",
      "start_ms": 210177,
      "end_ms": 211075
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "I'm sorry.\" Kai laughed.",
      "start_ms": 211075,
      "end_ms": 212479
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "He did not laugh often.",
      "start_ms": 212479,
      "end_ms": 213826
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "He said, \"Aiko.",
      "start_ms": 213826,
      "end_ms": 214724
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Do not be sorry.",
      "start_ms": 214724,
      "end_ms": 215678
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "I acted like I didn't care.",
      "start_ms": 215678,
      "end_ms": 217250
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "I gave you that impression.",
      "start_ms": 217250,
      "end_ms": 218822
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "It was for a reason.",
      "start_ms": 218822,
      "end_ms": 220001
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "It was not a good reason, but it was a reason.",
      "start_ms": 220001,
      "end_ms": 222639
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Now you know.",
      "start_ms": 222639,
      "end_ms": 223425
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "That is fine.",
      "start_ms": 223425,
      "end_ms": 224211
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Now — I need you to help me with one more thing.",
      "start_ms": 224211,
      "end_ms": 226962
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "The storm is going to be very loud.",
      "start_ms": 226962,
      "end_ms": 228983
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "It is going to shake the cabin.",
      "start_ms": 228983,
      "end_ms": 230779
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "It is going to sound like the walls are going to break.",
      "start_ms": 230779,
      "end_ms": 233923
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "They are not going to break.",
      "start_ms": 233923,
      "end_ms": 235551
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "But it will sound like it.",
      "start_ms": 235551,
      "end_ms": 237066
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "I need you to know that.",
      "start_ms": 237066,
      "end_ms": 238470
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "I need you to trust me when I tell you it is normal.\"",
      "start_ms": 238470,
      "end_ms": 241557
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "\"Okay,\" said Aiko.",
      "start_ms": 241557,
      "end_ms": 242624
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Kai said, \"Also I have set up your bed for you here, next to the fire.",
      "start_ms": 242624,
      "end_ms": 246609
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "I have set up my bed on the floor beside you.",
      "start_ms": 246609,
      "end_ms": 249192
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "I am going to sleep on the floor next to you tonight.",
      "start_ms": 249192,
      "end_ms": 252223
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "So you do not have to be alone.",
      "start_ms": 252223,
      "end_ms": 254019
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Is that okay?\" \"Yes,\" said Aiko.",
      "start_ms": 254019,
      "end_ms": 255872
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "\"That is okay.\" Kai nodded.",
      "start_ms": 255872,
      "end_ms": 257444
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "He lit the kerosene lantern.",
      "start_ms": 257444,
      "end_ms": 259072
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "He set it in the middle of the table.",
      "start_ms": 259072,
      "end_ms": 261205
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "He said, \"The storm will be here in maybe twenty minutes.",
      "start_ms": 261205,
      "end_ms": 264461
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Let us have supper first.\"",
      "start_ms": 264461,
      "end_ms": 266032
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Kai cooked supper.",
      "start_ms": 266032,
      "end_ms": 267099
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Simple food — pasta with butter and cheese.",
      "start_ms": 267099,
      "end_ms": 269569
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "He did it well.",
      "start_ms": 269569,
      "end_ms": 270467
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "He did not burn it.",
      "start_ms": 270467,
      "end_ms": 271590
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "He did not spill anything.",
      "start_ms": 271590,
      "end_ms": 273106
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Aiko watched him.",
      "start_ms": 273106,
      "end_ms": 274116
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "She was aware, all the time, that this was a Kai she had not known existed.",
      "start_ms": 274116,
      "end_ms": 278382
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "He served her.",
      "start_ms": 278382,
      "end_ms": 279224
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "He sat down.",
      "start_ms": 279224,
      "end_ms": 279954
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "They ate.",
      "start_ms": 279954,
      "end_ms": 280516
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "The wind outside was starting to get louder — a low howl that was slowly rising.",
      "start_ms": 280516,
      "end_ms": 285063
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Aiko could hear the trees moving.",
      "start_ms": 285063,
      "end_ms": 286971
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "She could hear the small tin roof of the woodshed making small sounds it did not usually make.",
      "start_ms": 286971,
      "end_ms": 292248
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "\"Aiko,\" Kai said, halfway through supper.",
      "start_ms": 292248,
      "end_ms": 294880
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "\"There is one more thing I have to tell you.",
      "start_ms": 294880,
      "end_ms": 297701
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Dad's chest thing.",
      "start_ms": 297701,
      "end_ms": 298892
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Do you know what it is.\" Aiko shook her head.",
      "start_ms": 298892,
      "end_ms": 301775
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "\"He has a heart problem.",
      "start_ms": 301775,
      "end_ms": 303342
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Something wrong with a valve.",
      "start_ms": 303342,
      "end_ms": 305222
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "That is why he had to go to the mainland today.",
      "start_ms": 305222,
      "end_ms": 308231
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "To see a specialist.",
      "start_ms": 308231,
      "end_ms": 309547
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "If it is bad — if it is what they think it might be — he might need surgery.",
      "start_ms": 309547,
      "end_ms": 314373
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "He might have to go to the mainland for weeks.",
      "start_ms": 314373,
      "end_ms": 317319
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Mom did not want to tell you until we knew.",
      "start_ms": 317319,
      "end_ms": 320077
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "But — I want you to know now.",
      "start_ms": 320077,
      "end_ms": 321957
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "In case it comes up.",
      "start_ms": 321957,
      "end_ms": 323273
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "In case you overhear something.",
      "start_ms": 323273,
      "end_ms": 325279
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "So you know.\" Aiko put down her fork.",
      "start_ms": 325279,
      "end_ms": 327661
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "She had thought her father was okay.",
      "start_ms": 327661,
      "end_ms": 329980
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "He had seemed the same.",
      "start_ms": 329980,
      "end_ms": 331484
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "But she had noticed her mother being quiet.",
      "start_ms": 331484,
      "end_ms": 334242
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Now she understood.",
      "start_ms": 334242,
      "end_ms": 335495
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "She said, \"Is he going to be okay.\" Kai said, \"I think so.",
      "start_ms": 335495,
      "end_ms": 339193
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "I think it is fixable.",
      "start_ms": 339193,
      "end_ms": 340635
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "The doctors think so too.",
      "start_ms": 340635,
      "end_ms": 342264
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "But we have to wait and see.",
      "start_ms": 342264,
      "end_ms": 344082
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Okay?\" Aiko nodded.",
      "start_ms": 344082,
      "end_ms": 345336
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "She started to cry a little.",
      "start_ms": 345336,
      "end_ms": 347153
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Not a lot.",
      "start_ms": 347153,
      "end_ms": 347843
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "Just a little.",
      "start_ms": 347843,
      "end_ms": 348783
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
